    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "A bell rings every 15 minutes and a whistle is blown every 18 minutes. The bell is rung and the whistle is blown at 8 a.m. How long will it be before the bell is rung and the whistle blown at the same time again?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "90 minutes (1 hour 30 minutes).",
      "worked": "Multiples of 15 are $15, 30, 45, 60, 75, 90, \\ldots$.\n\nMultiples of 18 are $18, 36, 54, 72, 90, \\ldots$.\n\nThe lowest common multiple is $90$, so they next sound together after 90 minutes (1 hour 30 minutes), at 9:30 a.m.",
